WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.689 --> 00:00:15.051
gulped. "That jet is going to crash!"

2
00:00:15.732 --> 00:00:17.133
Roxy flew up and caught the jet.

3
00:00:18.974 --> 00:00:20.895
She set it down in the stadium's parking lot.

4
00:00:28.639 --> 00:00:29.640
The passengers got out.

5
00:00:35.244 --> 00:00:36.444
"Thank you, Rocket Girl!"

6
00:00:36.725 --> 00:00:37.465
the pilot said.

7
00:00:39.266 --> 00:00:40.786
Roxy flew back into the stadium.

8
00:00:41.427 --> 00:00:42.527
The crowd was booing.

9
00:00:47.249 --> 00:00:48.669
a bad sport, Hitz!"

10
00:00:49.430 --> 00:00:51.611
"Cheater!" "You stink!"

11
00:00:53.011 --> 00:00:54.392
Fitz Hitz looked furious.

12
00:00:54.412 --> 00:00:55.972
"I don't stink.

13
00:00:56.333 --> 00:00:58.213
I'm the best baseball player ever!"

14
00:00:58.233 --> 00:01:01.875
"You're going to jail, Fitz!"

15
00:01:02.195 --> 00:01:02.815
Roxy said.

16
00:01:02.835 --> 00:01:07.493
"Never!" Fitz Hitz pressed a button on his uniform.

17
00:01:09.614 --> 00:01:12.055
Shwoomp! He zapped up into the giant baseball.

18
00:01:12.075 --> 00:01:16.397
"How dare you boo me!"

19
00:01:16.697 --> 00:01:18.158
Fitz shouted through a microphone.

20
00:01:18.178 --> 00:01:22.080
"My Battle Baseball can destroy this entire stadium!"

21
00:01:23.140 --> 00:01:24.701
The giant baseball began to hum.

22
00:01:25.281 --> 00:01:27.542
Sparks shot from it.

23
00:01:27.562 --> 00:01:29.863
Roxy made a fist and flew at the Battle Baseball.

24
00:01:30.464 --> 00:01:36.225
Pow! The baseball crashed into an empty section of seats.

25
00:01:37.346 --> 00:01:38.347
A hatch popped open.

26
00:01:39.247 --> 00:01:40.007
"Let's go, team!"

27
00:01:40.187 --> 00:01:40.968
Dale Rivers said.

28
00:01:41.788 --> 00:01:43.269
The Miners jumped out and escaped.

29
00:01:49.653 --> 00:01:52.034
Fitz Hitz flew the baseball toward Roxy.

30
00:01:55.456 --> 00:01:57.177
Roxy fired her eye laser beams.

31
00:01:57.797 --> 00:02:01.239
Whiz-hoo! The laser beams bounced off the Battle Baseball.

32
00:02:02.359 --> 00:02:03.260
They hit a snack bar.

33
00:02:05.048 --> 00:02:07.569
Pretzels, hot dogs, and other snacks went everywhere.

34
00:02:09.149 --> 00:02:11.170
A basket of French fries landed in Mara's lap.

35
00:02:13.690 --> 00:02:15.211
"Oops!" Roxy bit her lip.

36
00:02:15.811 --> 00:02:21.673
"I need to be more—" Zap!

37
00:02:22.233 --> 00:02:24.934
The Battle Baseball's powerful laser knocked her out of the stadium.

38
00:02:24.954 --> 00:02:27.774
"Oof!" Roxy landed in the parking lot.

39
00:02:29.055 --> 00:02:30.515
"Are you okay, Rocket Girl?"

40
00:02:30.715 --> 00:02:31.515
the pilot asked.

41
00:02:32.436 --> 00:02:33.096
Roxy nodded.

42
00:02:35.148 --> 00:02:36.809
Then she saw the jet's broken wing.

43
00:02:39.031 --> 00:02:39.811
She had an idea.

44
00:02:39.831 --> 00:02:44.895
"Nobody will ever boo me again!"

45
00:02:45.135 --> 00:02:45.935
Fitz Hitz said.

46
00:02:47.076 --> 00:02:48.937
The Battle Baseball hummed and sparked.

47
00:02:48.957 --> 00:02:52.540
"Save us, Rocket Girl!"

48
00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:53.480
someone said.

49
00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:55.762
"Where did she go?"

50
00:02:56.122 --> 00:02:56.963
someone else asked.

51
00:02:58.063 --> 00:02:58.924
"I'm right here!"

52
00:02:59.184 --> 00:03:00.385
Roxy flew into the stadium.

53
00:03:01.966 --> 00:03:04.368
Holding the jet's wing like a bat, she swung.

54
00:03:05.052 --> 00:03:09.836
Crack—Ka-boom! The Battle Baseball flew out of the stadium.

55
00:03:10.416 --> 00:03:11.617
It crashed into the mountains.

56
00:03:12.597 --> 00:03:13.338
Roxy smiled.

57
00:03:13.358 --> 00:03:15.219
"Home run!"

58
00:03:17.221 --> 00:03:20.663
Roxy flew out to the smashed Battle Baseball and grabbed Fitz Hitz.

59
00:03:21.864 --> 00:03:23.885
"You're going to jail, Fitz!"

60
00:03:24.266 --> 00:03:24.726
she said.

61
00:03:25.747 --> 00:03:26.848
Fitz hung his head.

62
00:03:32.364 --> 00:03:35.066
Dale Rivers was pitching when Roxy returned to the stadium.

63
00:03:35.726 --> 00:03:37.147
Her friends barely noticed her.

64
00:03:37.167 --> 00:03:38.528
"What did I miss?"

65
00:03:38.849 --> 00:03:39.269
she asked.

66
00:03:39.289 --> 00:03:41.511
"Shh!" Jack said.

67
00:03:41.531 --> 00:03:43.752
"We'll tell you later, after the game."

68
00:03:44.993 --> 00:03:46.014
Roxy looked at Mara.

69
00:03:46.034 --> 00:03:49.156
"Oh, you got a snack," Roxy said.

70
00:03:50.137 --> 00:03:50.817
Mara nodded.

71
00:03:51.417 --> 00:03:54.800
"Rocket Girl got some French fries for me."

72
00:03:55.720 --> 00:03:57.061
Terrell leaned toward his friend.

73
00:03:57.081 --> 00:03:58.823
"Good work, Roxy!"

74
00:03:59.483 --> 00:04:00.264
Roxy smiled.

75
00:04:00.869 --> 00:04:01.918
"Thanks, Terrell."
